---
title: Decision Logic
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph Session Type
        A(Primary evaluation of a new case)
        B(Primary evaluation of a known case) 
        C(follow up a registered patient)                          
    end

    subgraph Step 4 - History
        History1(Hepatic Impairment?)
        History2(Renal Impairment?)
        History3(Increased Risk of Seizure?)
        History4(Glucose Abnormalities?)
        History5(Hyperlipidemia?)
        History6(Increased Risk of Weight Gain?)
        History7(Risk of QT Prolongation?)
        History8(Risk of Orthostatic Hypotension?)
        History9(Hyperprolactinemia?)
        History10(Tardive dyskinesia?)
        History11(Dystonia?)
        History12(Parkinsonism?)
        History13(Akathisia?)
        History14(Tabacco Smoker?)
        History15(Marijuana Smoker?)
        History16(Lifetime Antipsychotic Exposure)
        History21(Name of Antipsychotic)
    end

    subgraph Step 5 - Treatment Considerations
        Treat1(Sedation a Major Issue?)
    end
    
    
    subgraph BN-1
        D[(Choose antipsychotic)]
    end

    subgraph BN-2
    end

    subgraph BN-3
        E[(Continuing the Same Antipsychotics or switch?)]
        F((Continue the same antipsychotic))
        F1{No}
        F2(Plan for LAI)
    end

    subgraph BN-4
        G[(Indication for Aripiprazole?)]
        H((Aripiprazole))
    end

    subgraph Step 1
        A1(ID)
    end
    subgraph Step 2
        A2{{PANSS}}
    end
    subgraph Step 3
        A3{{C-SSRS}}
    end
    A4@{ shape: flag, label: "Consider Clozapine" }

    A e1@--> A1
        e1@{ animation: slow }
    A1 e2@--> A2
        e2@{ animation: slow }
    A2 e3@--> A3
        e3@{ animation: slow }
    A3 e4@--> |Low Risk| History1
        e4@{ animation: slow }
    A3 --> |High Risk| A4
    A4 --> History1
    History1 e5@--> History2
        e5@{ animation: slow }
    History2 e6@--> History3
        e6@{ animation: slow }
    History3 e7@--> History4
        e7@{ animation: slow }
    History4 e8@--> History5
        e8@{ animation: slow }
    History5 e9@--> History6
        e9@{ animation: slow }
    History6 e10@--> History7
        e10@{ animation: slow }
    History7 e11@--> History8
        e11@{ animation: slow }
    History8 e12@--> History9
        e12@{ animation: slow }
    History9 e13@--> History10
        e13@{ animation: slow }
    History10 e14@--> History11
        e14@{ animation: slow }
    History11 e15@--> History12
        e15@{ animation: slow }
    History12 e16@--> History13
        e16@{ animation: slow }
    History13 e17@--> History14
        e17@{ animation: slow }
    History14 e18@--> History15
        e18@{ animation: slow }
    History15 e19@--> History16
        e19@{ animation: slow }
    History16 --> |Yes| History21
    History16 e20@--> |No| Treat1
        e20@{ animation: slow }
                                                                                       
    B1(Name of the current antipsychotic known?)
    B2{{C-SSRS}}
    B3(Consider Clozapine)
    B4{{PANSS}}
    B5(Agressive behavior?)
    B6(ID)
    

    B --> B6
    B6 --> B4
    B4 --> B2
    B2 --> |Low Risk| B5
    B5 --> |No| B1
    B5 --> |Yes| B3
    B2 --> |High Risk| B3
    B1 --> |No| D
    B1 --> |Yes| E
    E --> |Yes| F
    E --> F1
    F1 --> G
    F1 --> F2
    G --> |Yes| H
    G --> |No| D


    C1{{PANSS}}

    C --> C1
